                "retweet_count": 384,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "What a special day at USDA! Honored to welcome my friend Dr. @RealBenCarson as he was officially sworn in as the National Nutrition Advisor! \n\nFrom his decades of service as a healer and leader to his steadfast commitment to faith, family, and country, Dr. Carson embodies the values that drive our Farmers First mission every single day.\n\nWith six in ten Americans living with at least one chronic disease, his voice and insight will be powerful as we strengthen nutrition policy, improve health outcomes, and close loopholes that have left too many families without access to truly healthy foods.\n\nTogether with @POTUS, Dr. Carson, and our entire team, we are working to Make America Healthy Again! And to ensure America\u2019s farmers and families always come first. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8",
                "text_lang": "en",
