                "retweet_count": 9899,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "A great American living legend, my precious friend Dr. @RealBenCarson, is officially on the @USDA team! \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 Sworn in today as our new National Nutrition Advisor, he joins us in the fight to Make America Healthy Again! Standing at the bridge of farming, nutrition, and national security.\n\nDr. Carson\u2019s leadership will be vital as we work with @POTUS, @SecKennedy, and our great farmers to strengthen the health and vitality of America! So grateful for his servants heart. \u2665\ufe0f",
