                "retweet_count": 211,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Excited to have Dr. Ben Carson join our team at @USDA as the National Advisor for Nutrition, Health, and Housing! \n\nHis expertise will be invaluable in our mission to make America healthy again through common-sense policies that prioritize nutrition, rural healthcare, and accessible housing. \n\nTogether, we\u2019re working to fulfill President Trump\u2019s vision for a stronger, healthier America. \ud83d\udcaa\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8",
