                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today, I stood with @SecKennedy and @DrOzCMS to reaffirm a simple truth: America is at its best when we put FARMERS FIRST. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\n\nFrom regenerative agriculture to 6 new SNAP waivers, we\u2019re rebuilding a system that delivers real nutrition and real results for America\u2019s families.\n\nThanks to @POTUS\u2019 leadership, we\u2019re ending the failed food policies of the Biden era and charting a new path. One that SUPPORTS producers, STRENGTHENS our food supply, and helps MAKE AMERICA HEALTHY AGAIN! \ud83d\udcaa\ud83c\udf4e",
