                "text": "\u201cAll great change in America begins at the dinner table.\u201d - Ronald Reagan \ud83c\udf4e\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\n\nThat\u2019s why @POTUS is empowering states to restore nutrition and integrity to SNAP!!!\n\nEnsuring taxpayer dollars are used to refocus SNAP on integrity and healthier futures for America\u2019s kids. This work is such a privilege. I will never stop fighting for real change. \ud83d\udcaa\n\nRead more here \u2b07\ufe0f\nhttps://t.co/5SaAO3KYjw",
