                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The Whole Milk for Healthy Kids Act is a commonsense win for school nutrition and America\u2019s dairy farmers. \ud83d\udc04\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\n\nIt restores real choices kids actually enjoy and helps ensure the next generation grows up healthy and strong.\n\nIt\u2019s more than a policy change. It\u2019s a practical way to promote health nationwide, support our farmers, and help the next generation thrive.\n\nPutting Farmers First.\ud83e\udd47\nMaking America Healthy Again. \ud83e\udd5b\ud83d\udcaa\n\nThank you to @CongressmanGT, @RogerMarshallMD, and so many others who made this bipartisan bill happen!",
